---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';
import TextLink from './TextLink.astro';
import FaqItem from './FaqItem.astro';
---

<section class="px-5 sm:px-20 pt-24">
  <SectionLabel>Common questions</SectionLabel>

  <div class="mt-10 divide-y divide-divider border-b border-divider">
    <FaqItem question="How much does beCamp cost?">
      Nothing. beCamp is completely free, including the food, thanks to our generous
      sponsors.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="Can I attend just one day?">
      You can, but come both days if you're able. If you're attending Saturday's
      sessions, we ask that you also come to Friday's Pitch Night.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="How are topics decided?">
      Anyone can pitch a topic at Friday's Pitch Night. Attendees vote, and volunteers
      arrange the winners into Saturday's schedule that same evening.
    </FaqItem>
    <FaqItem question="Are there rules?">
      Just be kind, be curious, and treat everyone with respect. The full Code of
      Conduct is linked in the footer.
    </FaqItem>
  </div>

  <TextLink href="/faqs" class="mt-10 inline-block text-base">All FAQs →</TextLink>
</section>
